<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - America Online started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - America Online started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- EVEREN Securities said it started coverage of America Online with near- and long-term market outperform ratings.</p>
<p>-- Shares were unchanged at 35-1/4.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
